  m_text: 'Land one or more Free Games coins anywhere on the reels + Cash Collect
    to trigger the Free Games.

    The awarded number of Free Games is equal to
    all numbers on the Free Games coins in the triggering spin combined.

    During
    Free Games Cash Collect may land on the reels and collect all coins. Cash Collect
    landing during Free Games will remain frozen on screen for 3 spins.'
